# Exhaustive power-loss and crash-image sweeps that the per-commit Linux attestation skips.
# Each one alone takes over a minute on linux,8c (measured 2026-11-01), and the slowest set the
# whole attestation's wall time to about 40 minutes. They still run in full once per merged
# batch: scripts/linux-preflight.sh runs every workspace unit test, and the native crash-harness
# lane runs broca-crash-harness.
#
# Format: package|exact nextest test name|measured seconds
broca-crash-harness|v4_recovery_tests::v4_recovery_all_images_with_three_pending_appends|2007
broca-provider|transport::tests::warm_idle_crash_and_power_loss_reclaim_once|639
broca-module|actor::writer_reclaim::tests::reclaim_crash_and_power_loss_cuts_are_idempotent|328
broca-crash-harness|v4_recovery_tests::v4_recovery_all_images_with_two_pending_appends|86
